sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Student / Administrator
    participant Browser as Client Browser
    participant Filter as Security & Auth Filters
    participant Servlet as AuthServlet
    participant Service as AuthService
    participant Hash as SecurityUtil (BCrypt / SHA-256)
    participant Dao as UserDao
    participant DB as PostgreSQL 16

    Note over User, DB: User Registration Flow
    User->>Browser: Enters Full Name, Email, Password, Course
    Browser->>Filter: POST /auth/register (CSRF Token Verified)
    Filter->>Servlet: Forward to AuthServlet.handleRegister()
    Servlet->>Service: registerStudent(RegisterRequest)
    Service->>Dao: findByEmail(email)
    Dao->>DB: SELECT * FROM users WHERE email = ?
    DB-->>Dao: No record found
    Service->>Hash: hashPassword(rawPassword, cost=12)
    Hash-->>Service: $2a$12$...
    Service->>Hash: generateSecureToken() & hashToken()
    Service->>Dao: save(User with ROLE_STUDENT, is_verified=false)
    Dao->>DB: INSERT INTO users, user_roles, verification_tokens
    Service-->>Servlet: Registration Successful (Token Generated)
    Servlet-->>Browser: Redirect to /auth/verify-email?email=...

    Note over User, DB: Login & Authentication Flow
    User->>Browser: Enters Email & Password
    Browser->>Filter: POST /auth/login (CSRF Validated)
    Filter->>Servlet: Forward to AuthServlet.handleLogin()
    Servlet->>Service: authenticate(email, rawPassword, ipAddress)
    Service->>Dao: findByEmail(email)
    Dao->>DB: SELECT * FROM users JOIN roles...
    DB-->>Dao: User Record (Status, Password Hash)
    Service->>Hash: checkPassword(rawPassword, storedHash)
    Hash-->>Service: Valid Match (True)
    Service->>Service: Check is_active & is_verified
    Service->>Dao: recordLoginTimestamp(userId)
    Service-->>Servlet: AuthResult(User, Roles, Permissions)
    Servlet->>Servlet: Invalidate old session & create new session (Fixation Protection)
    Servlet->>Servlet: Set Session Attributes (user_id, roles, csrf_token)
    Servlet-->>Browser: HTTP 302 Redirect to Role Dashboard (Student / Admin / SuperAdmin)

